This template can be used to display a hyperlink to an ArchiMateView.

Usage of this template:
<pre>{{DisplayArchiMateDiagramUrl
|page=<string>           - The exact name or displaytitle of the page corresponding with the ArchiMateView to link to (mandatory)
|label=<string>          - The text label to display (optional). If omitted, a plain url is returned
}}</pre>

Example:
<pre>{{DisplayArchiMateDiagramUrl|page=Id-12345-67890}}</pre>

